{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A checkerboard of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> rows and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> columns has a number written in each square, beginning in the upper left corner, so that the first row is numbered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/8/6e84ec8d82ef6bb718c86886208e60721ebcff16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,\\ldots,17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, the second row <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/6/f46b889605fc016f6278176c6966dbd8e97dc680.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18,19,\\ldots,34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />, and so on down the board. If the board is renumbered so that the left column, top to bottom, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/9016103ecec0c370698e3f431b72dccbc7cd8fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,\\ldots,13,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />, the second column <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/e/11eb8925df574e09047ec4ff2eacd5e9412ee72a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14,15,\\ldots,26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" /> and so on across the board, some squares have the same numbers in both numbering systems. Find the sum of the numbers in these squares (under either system). \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/f/abfa359524070356c368b6cad6b51dd5a4f8a617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A)}\\ 222 \\qquad \\text {(B)}\\ 333\\qquad \\text {(C)}\\ 444 \\qquad \\text {(D)}\\ 555 \\qquad \\text {(E)}\\ 666$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"423\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Label the rows from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (from top to bottom) and the columns from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (from left to right). Consider the cell at the intersection of the row labeled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> and column labeled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p>Under the first system, the cell is numbered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/3/b7375ab835cde1e92952e1dcf3e77844b0be8560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17i + j + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"17\" />. Under the second system, the cell is numbered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/b/7db8ef3073cf9990f33df5b537989fa3f88694a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i + 13j + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p>So the cell is given the same number in both systems if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b3b3c1e18a928f378a906feb9b804ab1bcecfeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17i + j + 1 = i + 13j + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"199\" height=\"17\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/9/049240619029507591a4b3c0ad763a6c14cdf40d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i = \\frac{3}{4}j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"54\" height=\"38\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" /> are both integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811480f547c16afc74ffca555e4fd6c166ccfa68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i, j)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> must be one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05fcd8865dc2f99e907d8e4cb6f9b64fd3bb3413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{(0, 0), (3, 4), (6, 8), (9, 12), (12, 16)\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"282\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>The numbers placed in these five cells are thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda824526dff5d0931556afde524d876de672c0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 56, 111, 166, 221$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />, so their sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/4/1a4a70f7dfb599a2957b1c9547d9eae55ae37197.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 555}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gvbk8fyRfJ8\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gvbk8fyRfJ8</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qCkyf2XVJcg\">https://youtu.be/qCkyf2XVJcg</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12\" title=\"2000 AMC 12\">2000 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=